{"name": "Throne of Shards", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Throne of Shards is a dark fantasy card adventure set within a vast dungeon of shifting dangers and forgotten power.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"89\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540810/extras/59f26dc2d2bf1bfdc359877cabb7d8d3.avif?t=1782842680\" width=\"900\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep beneath a broken world lies a sprawling labyrinth of ruin, where each floor twists the rules of battle and tests those bold enough to descend. Drawn by whispers of power, glory, and the promise of the throne itself, adventurers enter the dungeon knowing few ever return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"660\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540810/extras/5e8af140e29a9b702c16f66ba8ae603c.poster.avif?t=1782842680\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540810/extras/5e8af140e29a9b702c16f66ba8ae603c.webm?t=1782842680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540810/extras/5e8af140e29a9b702c16f66ba8ae603c.mp4?t=1782842680\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"89\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540810/extras/304b07a130d8fe5bca7e6a91ff4c3782.avif?t=1782842680\" width=\"900\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect powerful cards, shape your strategy, and face brutal encounters as you push deeper into the unknown. Every floor brings new threats, new rules, and new opportunities to build your deck into something truly unstoppable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"350\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540810/extras/11b738ae688e41e5fbc8396c81da50ef.poster.avif?t=1782842680\" width=\"744\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540810/extras/11b738ae688e41e5fbc8396c81da50ef.webm?t=1782842680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540810/extras/11b738ae688e41e5fbc8396c81da50ef.mp4?t=1782842680\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"89\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540810/extras/804454e3b4115d385a38c5a89548443c.avif?t=1782842680\" width=\"900\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture through a dark and ever-changing dungeon, uncover its secrets, and fight your way toward the <strong>Throne of Shards</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"879\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540810/extras/5b73ed1022c150d23269a15865de3554.avif?t=1782842680\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A dark TCG where you explore a massive dungeon, collect cards, and fight brutal battles. Each floor introduces its own unique rules, twisting the experience in this classic card adventure.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540810/edb6cd9d6bf7b9377223b2ec1505fab4fe4d6c2c/header.jpg?t=1782842680", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Card Battler", "Deckbuilding", "Card Game", "Dungeon Crawler", "Fantasy", "Strategy"], "developers": "Yaril_Games", "publishers": "Yaril_Games", "release_date": "Jun 30, 2026", "price": "$19.99", "appid": "4540810", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "14 May 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/ZsonSj7tfX8", "first_seen": 1778716800.0}